.TH QUIPU-SEARCH-INDEX 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-search\-index \- Report, backfill or drop the search indexes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu search\-index\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-kind\fR] [\fB\-\-batch\-size\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report, backfill or drop the search indexes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-kind\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-batch\-size\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-search\-index\-status(1)
Report the state of a search index
.TP
quipu\-search\-index\-backfill(1)
Backfill a search index in batches
.TP
quipu\-search\-index\-drop(1)
Drop a search index
.TP
quipu\-search\-index\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
